1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:11,668
The ANC video library brings the films, walkthroughs, and venue experiences together. Start with a featured film, or explore a collection built around what you want to do.

2
00:00:12,568 --> 00:00:21,397
You don’t need to remember a title. Describe what you need, like who is covering the venue today. Search finds videos by their meaning and topics, as well as their names.

3
00:00:22,297 --> 00:00:31,675
Use the bookmark to save a video for later. Saved videos keeps your shortlist together. When you start watching, Continue watching remembers where you left off.

4
00:00:32,575 --> 00:00:41,796
Open a film to enter the screening room. Adjust the playback speed, expand the player with theater mode, or choose the next video from the running order beside it.

5
00:00:42,696 --> 00:00:53,145
Select Playlist to build your own collection. Give it a name, then add more videos as you browse. Your playlists stay with this browser, ready for the next meeting or project.

6
00:00:54,045 --> 00:01:03,632
For a ready-made viewing session, open a collection and choose Queue all. The queue button shows your running order. Use the arrows to move a video earlier or later.

7
00:01:04,532 --> 00:01:16,731
Share sends someone straight to a video, or to the exact moment you choose. The copied link is tracked, and Viewing analytics opens the reports. Find your next moment in the ANC video library.

